<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 22px; line-height: 24px;">Client spotlight: Slow travel pioneer Fresh Tracks Canada partners with Flywire, modernizing payments to speed-up booking and improve customer experience</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Offering simpler, secure, and global-friendly payments with Flywire, Fresh Tracks Canada has drastically cut down turnaround times on payments and booking confirmations – all while saving $750,000 in merchant fees.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
