</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">In Flywire’s new report, 300+ hotel leaders reported revenue loss – some as much as 10% – due to payment inefficiencies that are burdening staff and customers. We’re sharing insights to help your hotel increase revenue by simplifying payments and better capitalizing on money already on the table.</p> </td> 
