</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">“Travel providers, like Quasar Expeditions, operate within a complex global landscape that demands a payments solution capable of handling diverse currencies, myriad local payment methods, and stringent regulatory requirements across borders. Flywire is uniquely positioned to meet these challenges head-on by providing a highly localized and secure payment experience that simplifies cross-border transactions, accelerates reconciliation, and ultimately enhances the customer journey.”</p> </td> 
