<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 22px; line-height: 24px;">Payment Requests:</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Clients can now send stateless links to request an initial deposit from a payer. This means you can consistently use the same payment request link without requiring unique fields, or even an amount! This functionality also includes an option for payers to store their payment method that will create the contact in the client’s dashboard that you can charge at a later date if needed, such as for incidentals. Clients will still receive a guaranteed notification, similar to when someone makes a payment against a payment request. Below is an example of what this would look like for your payer. Please reach out to <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="mailto:travel_operations@flywire.com"><strong><u>travel_operations@flywire.com</u></strong></a></span> for more information.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-2olp7jlzrkp0a" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/0o5nxt9afk/en_us/images/68e95a481d5f5-1760123464.1203.png" alt="Payment Requests" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Clients now have the option to send a payment request that does not charge the payer until the due date for the first installment. This provides a benefit for clients who do not want payers to see the local currency amount until the payment is scheduled. If enabled, clients can choose this “scheduled charge” option when creating a payment request. This is a feature flag that can be turned on later this month by reaching out to <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="mailto:travel_operations@flywire.com"><strong><u>travel_operations@flywire.com</u></strong></a></span></li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 22px; line-height: 23px;"><strong>Invoicing:</strong></span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Clients can now view tax breakdown on a preview of an invoice. To have this visible within the preview, please enable within Mission Control to show itemized tax.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
