<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><em><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">If you have any questions or would like to learn more about taking advantage of these enhancements, don’t hesitate to reach out to your RM or email <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="mailto:travel_operations@flywire.com"><strong><u>travel_operations@flywire.com</u></strong></a></span>.</span></em></p> </td> 
